// Numeric input prompt (2026-08-10): `bid any on <memory> of <owner>` asks
// the current player for a number (InputType::Number); a range quantity
// bounds the prompt and out-of-range answers are rejected and re-asked.
// `bid 5 on <memory> of <owner>` (literal) writes without prompting.
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
memory Pot 0 on table

stage Play for current 1 times {
  bid any on Pot of table
  bid >= 1 and <= 10 on Bet of table
  end stage
}
